+# Third-party integration audit
+
+Review this list at least quarterly and whenever an integration is added. Any new origin must be added to the CSP in `src/middleware.ts`.
+
+| Origin | Purpose | Data sent | Safeguards | Last reviewed |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
+| `us-central1-web-devrel-apps.cloudfunctions.net` (`/times_cdn/lib/analytics-client.js`) | Analytics | Usage events | Opt-in only; skipped on GPC/DNT; `referrerPolicy=origin` | 2026-10-16 |
+| `us-central1-web-devrel-apps.cloudfunctions.net` (`/times_cdn/api/login`, `/register`) | Authentication | Username, password | HTTPS, `credentials: omit`, no referrer, nothing persisted client-side | 2026-10-16 |
+| `fonts.googleapis.com`, `fonts.gstatic.com` | Web font (Grenze) | IP, user agent | `referrerpolicy=no-referrer`; consider self-hosting | 2026-10-16 |
+| `cinemai-1026410574114.us-central1.run.app` | Teaser image | IP, user agent | Image only (`img-src`) | 2026-10-16 |
+| Ad network (`ad-client.js`) | Ads | — | Currently disabled; must be consent-gated before re-enabling | 2026-10-16 |
+
+## Open items
+- Self-host the font and teaser image to remove those third parties.
+- Replace `'unsafe-inline'` in `script-src` with nonces/hashes.
